\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Below is a detailed specification you can hand directly to another AI/developer. The goal is to build something that can 
\f1\b discover, research, score, verify, rank and generate outreach for 50+ brands
\f0\b0 , specifically for the Mercenta + existing Amazon UK Vendor model.\
