\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Amazon UK Vendor Brand Acquisition Intelligence Tool\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Core objective\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Build a research and prospecting system that identifies brands which are good candidates for this commercial model:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Brand with proven/growing consumer demand 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  brand agrees to wholesale/distribution relationship 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  brand is onboarded to Mercenta 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Mercenta provides UK distribution/operational infrastructure 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  existing Amazon UK Vendor relationship is used to supply Amazon UK 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Amazon generates purchase orders 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  repeat replenishment.
\f0\b0 \
This is 
\f1\b not
\f0\b0  an Amazon Seller Central/FBA sourcing tool.\
It should optimise for:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Brands with actual Amazon UK demand.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Brands that can realistically be acquired as wholesale/distribution partners.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Brands where Amazon UK could potentially become a meaningful supply channel.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Brands that fit Mercenta's self-service operational model.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Brands where there is a realistic path to reaching a commercial decision-maker.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Brands where there is evidence of channel whitespace or an opportunity to improve Amazon supply.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The system should ultimately answer:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 "Which 50 brands should we approach next, why, who should we contact, what should we say, and how likely are they to become an Amazon Vendor opportunity?"
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
